"use": "the airport's airside, ONE continuous paved surface (user, 2026-09-29: a plane must not cross open ground between the gates, the taxiway and the runway): the apron from the terminal's airside face (under the four gate bridges) down to the parallel taxiway, the taxiway flush against the 540 m runway (GTA scale) on the south edge; two narrow-bodies nose-in at gates 1 and 3 (adjacent gates are 35 m apart, under a 35.8 m span), a third on a remote stand, and the maintenance hangar opening onto the apron with a fourth inside",
